* The lab lift shaft's landing (openc2e Creatures 2 project, our own script
* and our own art from art/shaftfloor.py; owner, 2026-11-23: "there needs
* to be a floor graphic in this shaft where the norn is walking"). The right
* platform's floor (y 1739) runs on into the copper shaft (room 255, x
* 4225-4349; lift.cos), where creatures wait for the pod; with the pod
* elsewhere they stood on nothing to be seen. A slim landing in the pod's
* own materials now crosses the shaft at that level, its top face's front
* edge on the floor line. Plane 1395: behind the pod's far glass (1399) and
* floor (1400), so the pod passes in front of it, and behind creatures; in
* front of the shaft's rim piece (2 1 145, 1390). Not seen by creatures
* (ATTR 16) and click-through (TRAN). Run by openc2e after the world loads
* (Additions folder); made anew each load.

enum 2 1 167 kill targ next
inst new: simp zlsf 1 0 1395 0 setv cls2 2 1 167 setv attr 16 tran 1 0 mvto 4241 1736 slow
